# nexora-action-code: get_bfd_sessions
Value Filldown TOTAL_SESSIONS (\d+)
Value Filldown UP_SESSIONS (\d+)
Value Filldown INIT_MODE (\S+)
Value Required LD_RD (\d+/\d+)
Value SOURCE_ADDR (\S+)
Value DEST_ADDR (\S+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value HOLDTIME (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Total\s+sessions:\s+${TOTAL_SESSIONS}\s+Up\s+sessions:\s+${UP_SESSIONS}\s+Init\s+mode:\s+${INIT_MODE}\s*$$
  ^\s*${LD_RD}\s+${SOURCE_ADDR}\s+${DEST_ADDR}\s+${STATE}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
